<title>SYRIA: Syria sells 4,000 tonnes of lentils.</title>
<headline>Syria sells 4,000 tonnes of lentils.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria has sold 4,000 tonnes of lentils to foreign companies for export outside Syria, a spokesman for the General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He told reuters the quantity included 3,000 tonnes of whole red lentils which were sold at $501 per tonne, and 1,000 tonnes of split red lentils which were sold at $550 per tonne.</p>
